          "ruleId": "QA-PW-004",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Brittle multi-class CSS selector: `locator(\".btn.btn-primary > div:nth-child(2)\")`. — Structural selectors break on any DOM refactor and fail without telling you which behavior regressed. Fix: Prefer role-based locators: getByRole(), getByText(), getByLabel()."
          },
          "locations": [
