          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "`waitForTimeout()` hard sleep. — Fixed waits either wait too long (slow suite) or too little (flaky on slow machines). They encode hope, not synchronization. Fix: Replace with a web-first assertion (`await expect(locator).toBeVisible()`) or `locator.waitFor()`."
          },
